<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential rates appliance stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential rates appliance stocks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities put initial buy ratings on Sunbeam Corp, Coleman Co Inc and Maytag Corp, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- put hold ratings on Black and Decker Corp and Premark International Inc, the source said.</p>
</text>
